# React Components

- Default to Server Components. Add `"use client"` only on interactive leaves.
- Named exports for components. Default exports only for `src/app` pages, layouts, and route files.
- Colocate feature UI under `src/features/<name>/components`.
- Type props with an explicit `type` alias. Do not use `React.FC`.
- Keep functions small and avoid nesting beyond four levels.
- Compose primitives from `src/components/ui` instead of duplicating class strings.

```tsx
// BAD: client boundary at the page
"use client";
export default function ProjectsPage() { return <FilterableList />; }

// GOOD: page stays a server component
export default async function ProjectsPage() {
  const projects = await getProjectRepository().findAll();
  return <ProjectList projects={projects} />;
}
```
